    <!-- EN: Allow multiple critical passions -->
  <VSE.AllowMultiCritical>角色是否可以拥有多个“偏长”兴趣度</VSE.AllowMultiCritical>
    <!-- EN: If false, will ensure that only one Critical passion will generate per pawn, to avoid them overlapping and causing them both to be useless. -->
  <VSE.AllowMultiCritical.Desc>如果禁用此项，每个角色在生成时将只会拥有一个“偏长”兴趣度，多个同时存在会导致所有技能的学习速度都变得很慢。</VSE.AllowMultiCritical.Desc>
    <!-- EN: Critical effects passions -->
  <VSE.CriticalEffectPassions>“偏长”兴趣度的减益效果是否会影响其他技能</VSE.CriticalEffectPassions>
    <!-- EN: If false, the learn rate factor debuff on other skills from Critical will not effect other skills the pawn is passionate about. -->
  <VSE.CriticalEffectPassions.Desc>如果禁用此项，“偏长”兴趣度的“学习速度（其他技能）”减益将不会对角色其他兴趣度较高的技能造成影响。</VSE.CriticalEffectPassions.Desc>
